  "description": "Make a task that is already here ring at a given moment. Adds to whatever it rings at already and never takes one away, so a reminder the person set themselves is safe. `read` says what it carries before you add. Use it for the appointment that was filed without one, and leave alone what repeats — a routine already comes back on its own.",
